<!-- ─── A PART OF LIFE & PHILOSOPHY SECTION ─── -->
<section class="sec" id="life" aria-label="A Part of Life and Philosophy">
  <div class="r">
    <div class="sec-label">The Human Layer & Operating Philosophy</div>
    <h2 class="sec-title">A Part of Life:<br><span>Relentless Execution & Mindful Living</span>.</h2>
    <p class="sec-sub">Sustainable high performance isn't burning out on short-term hacks. It's engineering disciplined leverage across automated systems, continuous learning, and life curiosity.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="life-grid">
    <!-- Card 1: Daily Rhythm -->
    <div class="life-card r">
      <div class="life-card-header">
        <span class="life-tag">Daily Architecture</span>
        <span class="life-card-icon">⏱️</span>
      </div>
      <h3>The Daily Flywheel</h3>
      <p class="life-card-sub">A disciplined operating schedule structured around deep work, production execution, and creative recharge.</p>

      <div class="rhythm-timeline">
        <div class="rhythm-item">
          <div class="rhythm-bullet"></div>
          <div class="rhythm-content">
            <div class="rhythm-time">06:30 AM · Cognitive Flow</div>
            <div class="rhythm-title">Deep Architecture & AI Research</div>
            <div class="rhythm-desc">Evaluating emerging LLM capabilities, paper breakdowns, and workflow design before client notifications awaken.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rhythm-item">
          <div class="rhythm-bullet"></div>
          <div class="rhythm-content">
            <div class="rhythm-time">11:30 AM · Production Ops</div>
            <div class="rhythm-title">Growth Engines at Orielix</div>
            <div class="rhythm-desc">Scaling B2B lead pipelines, tuning Meta Ads ROAS, and orchestrating live n8n webhooks for enterprise clients.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rhythm-item">
          <div class="rhythm-bullet"></div>
          <div class="rhythm-content">
            <div class="rhythm-time">05:30 PM · Academic Rigor</div>
            <div class="rhythm-title">CS & Machine Learning</div>
            <div class="rhythm-desc">JECRC University coursework: Neural architectures, distributed databases, and algorithmic foundations.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rhythm-item">
          <div class="rhythm-bullet"></div>
          <div class="rhythm-content">
            <div class="rhythm-time">09:30 PM · Creative Reset</div>
            <div class="rhythm-title">Anime, Reading & Ideation</div>
            <div class="rhythm-desc">Unwinding with masterclass anime storytelling, dissecting D2C brand models, and daily reflection.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 2: Mental Models -->
    <div class="life-card r">
      <div class="life-card-header">
        <span class="life-tag">Operating Code</span>
        <span class="life-card-icon">🧠</span>
      </div>
      <h3>Mental Models & Principles</h3>
      <p class="life-card-sub">The non-negotiable mental principles that govern every product built, client campaign scaled, and decision made.</p>

      <div class="principles-list">
        <div class="principle-box">
          <div class="principle-title">
            <span class="principle-num">01/</span> Systems Over Hustle
          </div>
          <div class="principle-desc">If a task is repeated three times manually, engineer an automated agent to run it autonomously forever.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="principle-box">
          <div class="principle-title">
            <span class="principle-num">02/</span> Compounding Leverage
          </div>
          <div class="principle-desc">Code, media, and autonomous workflows are permissionless leverage. Build digital assets that generate value 24/7.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="principle-box">
          <div class="principle-title">
            <span class="principle-num">03/</span> Creative Rigor Backed by Math
          </div>
          <div class="principle-desc">Compelling creative hooks grab attention; ruthless conversion metrics and positive unit economics make it scale.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="principle-box">
          <div class="principle-title">
            <span class="principle-num">04/</span> Autodidact Bias to Action
          </div>
          <div class="principle-desc">No gatekeeper permission required. From bootstrapping e-commerce at 18 to next-gen search, everything is mastered by shipping.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 3: Passions & The Journey -->
    <div class="life-card r">
      <div class="life-card-header">
        <span class="life-tag">Beyond Terminal</span>
        <span class="life-card-icon">⚡</span>
      </div>
      <h3>Curiosity & Life Passions</h3>
      <p class="life-card-sub">Fueling technical endurance through narrative craft, founder community, and entrepreneurial curiosity.</p>

      <div class="passions-grid">
        <div class="passion-pill">
          <div class="passion-pill-top">
            <span>🎌</span> Anime Storytelling
          </div>
          <div class="passion-pill-desc">Inspired by epic story arcs, relentless character discipline, and high-concept world design.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="passion-pill">
          <div class="passion-pill-top">
            <span>💡</span> Micro-Tool Prototyping
          </div>
          <div class="passion-pill-desc">Rapidly testing lightweight calculators and utilities that solve real digital marketing problems.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="passion-pill">
          <div class="passion-pill-top">
            <span>🤝</span> Founder Community
          </div>
          <div class="passion-pill-desc">Sharing daily unfiltered playbooks, workflows, and experiments with 4,800+ growth operators on LinkedIn.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="passion-pill">
          <div class="passion-pill-top">
            <span>🏰</span> Jaipur Heritage & Roots
          </div>
          <div class="passion-pill-desc">Grounded in the entrepreneurial energy, culture, and architectural majesty of Pink City, India.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top: 1.5rem; padding: 1.1rem; background: rgba(255, 133, 51, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 133, 51, 0.25); border-radius: 12px;">
        <div style="font-size: 0.84rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">
          "The best systems feel invisible. The best life feels intentional."
        </div>
        <div style="font-size: 0.76rem; color: var(--orange-hover);">Kuldeep Sharma</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
